# //ui:dist and //desktop:app are intentionally host-local packaging actions
# until their JavaScript toolchains move to rules_js. Propagating PATH lets
# those explicit targets find the Bun/Node installation selected by the
# developer or release runner; Go compilation remains fully declared.
build --action_env=PATH
# The release daemon always embeds the renderer produced by the declared Vite
# genrule. Direct `go test` deliberately selects the tiny source fallback so
# inner-loop Go tests do not require Bun.
build --define gotags=bazel_ui_archive
